## 🧱 RAX Format

### Magic

```

RAX = 0x52 41 58

Internal subformats
INAB → Media.Vision container layer
LAPB → script/animation tables
TXR → embedded textures
AHX → embedded audio
TDMV → dialogue blocks
DCMV → cutscene data
LZSS → compression layer
DPK → embedded databases
💬 Dialogue System (PAC_ Files)

All story text is distributed across multiple RAX files:

PAC_TOWN##_01.RAX
PAC_MAIN##_##.RAX
PAC_ROUTE##_##.RAX
PAC_MIND_##.RAX
PAC_EVMAP##_01.RAX
Format
[VOICE_ID][TEXT]

Example:

M00-002ここは、どこだ……？
Mapping
VOICE_ID → voice.cvm audio file
TEXT → subtitle displayed in-game
📊 Text Extraction Scope
Category	Approx. entries
Dialogue (PAC_*)	~16,631
