Total	~23,000
🧾 DPK Format

Binary database format used for:

UI text
enemy names
item descriptions
world data
Structure
Fixed header
pointer table
Shift-JIS encoded strings
0x00 separators
🎭 TDMV Format (Advanced Dialogue Blocks)
Magic
TDMV = 0x54 44 4D 56
Structure
Speaker name (Shift-JIS)
Voice ID
Dialogue text (multi-line supported)
Usage
Intro sequences
System messages
Special scripted events
🎬 Intro (TITLE.RAX)
Compressed with LZSS
Extracted via PS2 RAM dump (PCSX2)
Contains narrative introduction

Key characters:

ラッシィ (Rasshi)
久遠の森の詠み手 (Narrator of the Eternal Forest)
🎧 Audio System (AHX / ADX)
.ADX → main voice lines
.AHX → effects/music

Naming convention:

SND_BVO_[NAME]##_###.AHX

