📈 Key Findings
Dialogue is fully data-driven via voice ID mapping
Multiple overlapping PAC containers exist per scene
RAX files can contain nested RAX + audio + script layers
Intro text is not stored as plain files (compressed in RAM)
PCSX2 savestates use Zstandard compression
🔧 Known Challenges
LZSS variant used by Media.Vision not fully decoded
TDMV reinsertion tooling required
RAX repacking not yet implemented
Some DPK formats still partially unknown
